and I don't know what it is.

00:00:02.976 --> 00:00:04.717
- The fact that there's no milk in it?

00:00:04.717 --> 00:00:06.333
- Yeah, that's probably it.
(both laugh)

00:00:11.215 --> 00:00:14.023
- [Man] Mmm, soy creamy.
- [Woman] Soy creamy.

00:00:14.023 --> 00:00:15.789
- I wanna clink, should we clink?

00:00:15.789 --> 00:00:18.180
- It just tastes like melted Play-Doh.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.940
- When you accidentally
leave something plastic

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.552
on the burner in your house
and you start to smell it.

00:00:22.552 --> 00:00:23.506
- Tastes bad.

00:00:23.506 --> 00:00:25.316
- Really? I'm totally fine with this.

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:27.197
- I could eat this alone.

00:00:27.197 --> 00:00:28.331
- I could eat it alone.

00:00:28.331 --> 00:00:31.539
- Yeah, just alone by myself in my room.

00:00:31.539 --> 00:00:32.863
- I think it's kinda good.

00:00:32.863 --> 00:00:34.778
- Well, you're a vegan.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.220
- It tastes like chemicals. It doesn't--

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.186
- Yeah, I don't--

00:00:39.186 --> 00:00:40.768
- I think I would rather have

00:00:40.768 --> 00:00:45.188
milk and diarrhea than chemicals.

00:00:45.188 --> 00:00:47.970
- Tastes like a spoonful
of cold, soft almonds.

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.218
- Yeah, I'm not a fan of that. (laughs)

00:00:49.218 --> 00:00:50.148
- [Man in glasses] Yeah.

00:00:50.148 --> 00:00:51.908
- It's funny because I keep
saying I'm not a fan of it

00:00:51.908 --> 00:00:54.323
but I keep eating it, so maybe
I am a fan of it. (laughs)

00:00:54.323 --> 00:00:57.772
- It's the sad, desperate
smell of a new beginning.

00:00:58.799 --> 00:00:59.862
- [Man] Oh, this is awful!

00:00:59.862 --> 00:01:01.811
- This tastes exactly like
birthday cake frosting.

00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:04.018
- Oh, this is the worst one.

00:01:04.018 --> 00:01:06.502
It's got so much sugar
in it for no reason.

00:01:06.502 --> 00:01:09.423
- [Woman] Mm-hmm.
- [Man] Oh, it's bad.

00:01:09.423 --> 00:01:13.520
- For a second, it just tasted
like a Rice Krispies Treat.

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:14.284
That would've been good.

00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:16.675
If it always tasted like
a Rice Krispies Treat,

00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:18.277
then I'd be onboard.

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:20.592
But it was just there and gone.

00:01:20.592 --> 00:01:21.982
- Oh, god.

00:01:21.982 --> 00:01:23.466
- I don't like that at
all. That one's terrible.

00:01:23.466 --> 00:01:24.824
- [Woman] No, it tastes like plastic.

00:01:24.824 --> 00:01:25.962
- [Man] No, that one's awful.

00:01:25.962 --> 00:01:27.163
- Oh, what the (bleep) is that?

00:01:27.163 --> 00:01:31.830
