00:01:38.118 --> 00:01:41.322
- By the way, it's not just
vanilla, it's vanilla island.

00:01:41.322 --> 00:01:43.830
- Oh. What a (bleep) island.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:46.314
Well they've put a lot of
care into this packaging,

00:01:46.314 --> 00:01:48.915
so they want you to think
that this is good for you,

00:01:48.915 --> 00:01:50.749
that this is gonna improve your chakras

00:01:50.749 --> 00:01:52.958
