00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.709
You put a little rum in this

00:02:00.709 --> 00:02:02.892
and you can get real drunk, real quick.

00:02:02.892 --> 00:02:06.652
- It just, it tastes good, but
also, it tastes like lotion.

00:02:06.652 --> 00:02:09.565
- Smells like something
I wanna rub on my skin.

00:02:09.565 --> 00:02:13.526
- So if you want a coconut
cream pie in ice cream form--

00:02:13.526 --> 00:02:14.902
- [Dark-haired man] Yeah.
- [Man with glasses] Get this.

00:02:15.861 --> 00:02:16.762
- [Man] Yup, we did it. We did it.

00:02:16.762 --> 00:02:17.782
- It's so good.

00:02:17.782 --> 00:02:18.897
- We did it , America.

00:02:18.897 --> 00:02:21.093
We made an ice cream that's decent to eat.

00:02:22.282 --> 00:02:23.559
